      "id": "https://newatlas.com/outdoors/16-sec-modular-chuk-box/",
      "url": "https://newatlas.com/outdoors/16-sec-modular-chuk-box/",
      "title": "[New Atlas] 16-sec stackable camp box jumping-jacks into a solo or group cookery",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8131434/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1680x882+0+288/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2F0a%2F0d77123b437885dfa41401f01522%2Fgrey-and-green-stacked-chuk-kitchen-box-1-copy.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8131434/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1680x882+0+288/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2F0a%2F0d77123b437885dfa41401f01522%2Fgrey-and-green-stacked-chuk-kitchen-box-1-copy.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p><img alt=\"Chuk boxes stacks and store neatly together for the most efficient use of space in crowded camping vehicles\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0a0c949/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1680x1457+0+0/resize/1107x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2F0a%2F0d77123b437885dfa41401f01522%2Fgrey-and-green-stacked-chuk-kitchen-box-1-copy.jpg\" /><p>Nearly two years ago, we took a look at the Brio Kitchen Box that was running on Kickstarter at the time. We hadn't heard much about the project since, but then the full-blown production model showed up at Overland Expo Mountain West. Only it wasn't called the Brio – it was rebranded the Chuk Box. Happily, the name seems to be the only major change, as the box brings the same stackable portability and modular performance to car and camp.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/16-sec-modular-chuk-box/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/\">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/\" rel=\"tag\">Camping</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/cooking/\" rel=\"tag\">Cooking</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/brio/\" rel=\"tag\">BRIO</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/kitchen/\" rel=\"tag\">Kitchen</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/outdoor/\" rel=\"tag\">Outdoors and Camping</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/picnic/\" rel=\"tag\">Picnic</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/overland-expo-mountain-2026/\" rel=\"tag\">overland-expo-mountain-2026</a></p>",
      "date_published": "2026-09-25T01:37:00+00:00",
      "authors": [
